  "definition": "Capacity Limits",
  "effectiveDate": "2024-02-06",
  "historyNote": "#6619-B, eff 10-29-97; (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Sw 1200) ss by #8459, eff 10-28-05 (formerly Env-Wm 2904.04); ss by #10595, eff 7-1-14; ss by #13865, eff 2-6-24",
